                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I mean its free, graphics are top notch, as is the voice acting.\n\nBut its just... lacking.\n\nThe whole game is: you spawn strapped in a chair next to some medical instruments and he comes, he monologues for 7 minutes and its over... \n\nThe dialogue is great, ambient is ok, pretty creepy...\n\nbut there is nothing... else? i was expecting the curtains to drop and show something that wowed me... but it never comes...\n\nAll in all a bit underwhelming, and its 2gb so quite \"heavy\" for such a short experience.\n\nIf i could i would give a neutral recommendation because production value is through the roof, but i cant give a neutral review, so i have to lean on the negative because its just not an app id recommend.",
